{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>ואל ישעו.</b> Rashi explained: 'and let them not pay attention.' But it is not like 'וישע,' for that is expounded as 'ויפן.' And the fact that Rashi explained regarding 'וישע אל הבל' — and it is like 'ואל ישעו' — he did not intend from the word ישעו of this verse, but rather from 'אל ולא ישעו אל המזבחות' of Jeremiah or of Isaiah, which is also expounded as 'אל יפנו.'"], :book :exodus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:02:43.665498214Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}